        "TileImage": "$($repository 76093a1e-fc60-4207-ae0c-91a2b6c4f226).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47, \rICA have located 3 syndicate agents in Dubai, all former assassins and organised crime subordinates. It&apos;s time we put an end to their era.\r\rMichael Tolman - Electrician, Maybe something will go wrong on the job.\r\rMariam Amir - She&apos;s always dreamed of flying, Her role entails working near a balcony - why not make her dream come true.\r\rOscar Malm - Also an eletrical worker, Maybe he didn&apos;t get quite enough. ahem. &quot;On-the-job training&quot;\r\rGood Luck 47, \rI shall leave you to prepare",
